sequenceDiagram
    participant L as LINE
    participant W as Webhook
    participant A as Agent
    participant K as Knowledge
    participant H as Human Support
    L->>W: Message
    W->>W: Verify and deduplicate
    W->>A: Build tenant-aware context
    A->>K: Retrieve knowledge
    K-->>A: Ranked context
    alt Supported answer
      A-->>L: Send response
    else Needs support
      A->>H: Create escalation
      H-->>L: Send handoff message
    end

